{"id":"poudre","lemma":"poudre","pos":"noun","rank":2140,"glosses":["powder"],"ipa":"/pudʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4f/Fr-poudre.ogg/Fr-poudre.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"poudres"},"formAudio":{"poudres":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-poudres.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je n'aime pas le sucre en poudre.","en":"I don't like powdered sugar.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"sugar"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"La nouvelle se répandit comme une traînée de poudre.","en":"The news spread like wildfire.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to spill, scatter","l":"répandre"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"trail"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Une étincelle déclencha l'explosion de la poudre à canon.","en":"A spark caused the gunpowder to explode.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"spark"},{"g":"to trigger","l":"déclencher"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"explosion"},null,null,null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"cannon, gun"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"La poudre à canon doit être manipulée avec beaucoup de précautions.","en":"Gunpowder needs to be handled very carefully.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"cannon, gun"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"precaution","l":"précaution"}]},{"text":"La nouvelle s’est répandue comme une traînée de poudre.","en":"The news spread like wildfire.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"widespread","l":"répandu"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"trail"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}